Package: python3-hebrew
Version: 1.7
Section: python
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-regex
Maintainer: Reuben Institute <reubeninstitute@gmail.com>
Description: Hebrew text and numeral utilities
 Provides Hebrew and HebrewNumbers modules for working with
 Hebrew text (letter constants, transliteration helpers) and
 Hebrew numeral (gematria) conversion.
